  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 47 (Tuesday, March 14, 2023)]\n[House]\n[Pages H1287-H1288]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. NORTON:\nH.R. 1599.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nclause 3 of section 8 of article I of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThis bill would require employers to provide the salary\nrange for jobs in advertisements and interviews and to\nexisting employees.\n[[Page H1288]]\n</pre>",
